<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover">
    <title>Under Maintenance 🏴‍☠️</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.2/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            -webkit-user-select: none;
            user-select: none;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background: #0a0a0a;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 50%, rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.03) 0%, transparent 60%),
                radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 20%, rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.02) 0%, transparent 50%),
                linear-gradient(180deg, #0a0a0a 0%, #0d0d0d 100%);
        }

        .maintenance-card {
            max-width: 400px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 48px 32px 40px;
            background: rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-radius: 24px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.08);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.03);
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .maintenance-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.03) 0%, transparent 70%);
            pointer-events: none;
            animation: rotate 20s linear infinite;
        }

        @keyframes rotate {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        .icon-wrapper {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            background: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.08);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.1);
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .icon-wrapper i {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: #FFD700;
        }

        .maintenance-card h1 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFD700, #D4A800);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .maintenance-card p {
            color: #888;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .maintenance-card .sub {
            color: #555;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            margin-top: 16px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .loader {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            margin: 24px auto 16px;
            border: 3px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.08);
            border-top: 3px solid #FFD700;
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: spin 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.6, 0, 0.4, 1) infinite;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        @keyframes spin {
            to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        .gold-line {
            width: 60px;
            height: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #FFD700, transparent);
            margin: 0 auto 16px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .maintenance-card .emoji-deco {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #444;
            margin-top: 4px;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .follow-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 12px 32px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFD700, #D4A800);
            border: none;
            border-radius: 60px;
            color: #0a0a0f;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            text-decoration: none;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .follow-btn i {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .follow-btn:hover {
            transform: scale(0.97);
            box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.4);
        }

        .follow-btn:active {
            transform: scale(0.95);
        }

        @media (max-width: 400px) {
            .maintenance-card {
                padding: 32px 20px 28px;
            }
            .icon-wrapper {
                width: 64px;
                height: 64px;
            }
            .icon-wrapper i {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
            .maintenance-card h1 {
                font-size: 1.2rem;
            }
            .follow-btn {
                padding: 10px 24px;
                font-size: 0.8rem;
            }
        }
    </style>

    <div class="maintenance-card">
        <div class="icon-wrapper">
            <i class="fas fa-anchor"></i>
        </div>
        <h1>Under Maintenance</h1>
        <p>GRAM PIRATES is currently being updated</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:#666;margin-top:4px;">We'll be back soon</p>
        <div class="loader"></div>
        <div class="gold-line"></div>
        <a href="https://t.me/GramPTS" target="_blank" class="follow-btn">
            <i class="fab fa-telegram-plane"></i> Follow News
        </a>
        <div class="sub">🏴‍☠️ Thank you for your patience</div>
    </div>
</body>
    </html>
